"在北界王神的特殊环境中全力抵挡自身打出的攻击，提高自身能反弹的总伤害。": "In the special environment of King Kai, reflects attacks hit by yourself to improve the total DMG you can reflect",
"被动：提高$点反弹伤害": "Passive: Reflect DMG +$",
'["反弹伤害+$"]': '["Reflect DMG +$"]',
"伙伴被动": "Partner Passive",
"无敌并且不移动": "Becomes invincible and immobile",
"居合斩": "Iaizan",
"对所有敌人造成最大生命值的一定比例伤害。(伤害必然命中)": "Deals DMG equal to the MAX HP to all enemies (Irresistible)",
"造成最大生命值的%伤害": "Deals DMG equal to % of Max HP",
'["伤害+%"]': '["DMG +%"]',
