"提高自身抵抗所有负面效果的几率，自身受到伤害最多不超过最大生命值的一定比例，提高自身所有攻击的暴击率和暴击伤害。": "Increases own Debuff Resist rate. DMG taken will not exceed a certain portion of Max HP. Increases CRIT rate and CRIT DMG of own attacks.",
"被动：%几率抵抗负面效果，单次最多受到最大生命值的%伤害，提高%攻击伤害，提高%暴击率": "Passive:% Debuff Resist rate, DMG taken will not exceed % of Max HP, ATK DMG +%, CRIT rate +%",
'["抵抗负面效果几率+%","受到伤害-%","攻击伤害+%","暴击率+%"]': '["Debuff Resist rate +%", "DMG taken -%", "ATK DMG +%", "CRIT rate +%"]',
"维斯普攻": "Whis Normal ATK",
"破坏协奏曲": "Havoc Concerto",
"召唤许多强大的能量球并向前砸去，对所有敌人造成%%攻击力的魔法伤害并无视吸收和反弹盾，若目标生命低于18%则斩杀对方。": "Summons many powerful Energy balls and hurls them forward dealing MAG DMG equal to %% of ATK which ignores absorption and the reflect shield. Kills targets with HP lower than 18%.",
"额外造成40%攻击力的魔法伤害，额外造成最大生命值10%的伤害": "Deals extra MAG DMG equal to 40% of ATK and extra DMG equal to 10% of Max HP",
"终结之击": "Final Strike",
"将最前排一个敌人击退至最后一排，用法杖连续发出能量球对目标造成$次最大生命值的一定比例伤害并无视吸收和反弹盾，此技能不增加敌人的受击能量。": "Repels an enemy in the front row to the last and emits Energy balls with a wand dealing DMG equal to a portion of Max HP which ignores absorption and the reflect shield to the targets $ times. This skill doesn't increase DMG Taken Energy of enemies..",
"自身额外恢复10%生命值和250点能量": "Restores own HP by an additional 10% and 250 Energy",
"天使庇护": "Guardian Angel",
"使用天使能力恢复全体队友能量并清除所有负面效果，为最虚弱的$个队友恢复生命值。": "Restores the Energy of all teammates and removes all debuffs. Restores HP of the $ weakest teammates.",
"全体队友额外提高30%攻击伤害和30%暴击率持续9秒": "Increases ATK DMG and CRIT rate of all teammates by an additional 30% for 9 sec.",
"我军恢复$点能量\n队友恢复%生命值": "Restores $ team Energy\nRestores HP of teammates by %",
'["恢复能量+$","恢复生命值+%"]': '["Restore Energy +$","Restore HP +%"]',
"时光回溯": "Time Rewind",
"提高自身闪避率和抵抗所有负面效果的几率，自身受到伤害最多不超过最大生命值的一定比例。": "Increases own EVA rate and Debuff Resist rate. DMG taken will not exceed a certain portion of Max HP.",
"被动：额外有%几率闪避所有攻击，%几率抵抗负面效果，单次最多受到最大生命值的%伤害": "Passive: An extra % chance to evade all attacks, % Debuff Resist rate, DMG taken will not exceed % of Max PH",
'["闪避几率+%","抵抗负面效果几率+%","受到伤害-%"]': '["EVA rate +%","Debuff Resist rate +%","DMG taken -%"]',
