"根据《关于防止未成年人沉迷网络游戏的通知》规定，用户需要进行实名认证，请输入您本人真实有效的个人信息，提交认证通过后将无法修改。": 'According to the "Notice on Preventing Minors from Indulging in Online Games", users need to perform real-name authentication. Please enter your true and valid personal information. After the authentication is submitted, it cannot be modified.',
