"在这里挑战对手可以获得大量金币和奖励哦。": "Challenge opponents here to get a lot of Gold and rewards.",
"点击这里进入<无尽蛇道>。": "Tap here to enter <Snake Way>",
"挑战无尽蛇道可以获得大量宝石，每天可重置并扫荡一次。": "Challenge Snake Way to get a lot of gems. This dungeon can be reset and raided once a day.",
"扫荡会根据最高通关来计算奖励，建议先尽力通关后再扫荡。": "Raid rewards will be given based on the highest stage record. Try to clear as many stages as possible before purging.",
"点击这里进入<体能训练>。": "Tap here to enter <Physical Training>.",
"在这里可以和其他玩家一起抢夺训练位置，根据位置名次和训练时间结算奖励。": "You can grab the training position with other players here. Rewards will be given based on your position and training time.",
"当然也可以在单人房自己训练，可避免被其他玩家抢位。": "You can also do the training in a single room to avoid your position being grabbed by other players.",
"点击这里进入<拯救地球>。": "Tap here to enter <Save the Earth>.",
"拯救地球可以获得大量烤鱼，用于伙伴强化。": "Save the earth to get a lot of grilled fish, which can be used to strengthen partners.",
"请查看规则后派出相应的战士上阵可打出更高的伤害。": "Check the rules and deploy corresponding warriors to deal higher DMG.",
"点击这里进入跨服战场。": "Tap here to enter C.S. Battle.",
"点击这里进入<北界王特训>。": "Tap here to enter <King Kai Training>",
"在这里可以选择不同的地图进行特训，可获得大量界王币、钻石、金币、圣水。": "Here you can select different maps for special training and obtain K-Coins, Diamonds, Gold and Sacred Water.",
"点击这里进入<沙鲁游戏>。": "Tap here to enter <Cell Games>.",
"根据等级划分多个战场，点击这里进入你所在的战场。": "Players are divided into different warzones based on their levels. Tap here to enter your warzone.",
"这里可以进行沙鲁游戏,上阵3队战士参与竞技吧。": "You can join Cell Games here. Deploy 3 teams of warriors to join the arena.",
"点击这里进入<讨伐弗利萨>。": "Tap here to enter <Combat Frieza>",
"在这里可以和同个家族成员组队进行讨伐弗利萨，还能跨服扰乱其他家族的队伍，可获得大量声望币。": "Here you can Combat Frieza with your Clanmembers. Or you can plunder the escorts of other Clans in C.S Plunder for F-Coins.",
"点击这里进入<跨服组队战>。": "Tap here to enter <C.S. Team Battle>.",
"在这里可以和同个区的玩家组队，通过战斗获得积分进入排行榜，可获得大量巅峰币和烤鱼。": "Here you can team up with players in the same zone, gain points through battles to get ranked, and get plenty of U-Coins and grilled fish.",
"当前网络不可用，点击确定重试": "Current network is unavailable, tap OK to try again",
"登陆校验失败，请重新登陆": "Login verification failed. Log in again.",
