"分身能力提高至自身能力的80%，消失时为自身恢复6%最大生命值与125点能量": "The clones take 80% of original's Ability. Heals 6% Max HP and 125 Energy when clones disappear",
"咆哮": "Angry Shout",
"持续拍击胸口$秒，期间自身免疫控制，自身和最虚弱的$个队友每秒恢复生命值和能量。": "Slap hard on it's chest for $ sec, granting immunity to control. Restores HP & Energy to $ weakest teammate(s) every sec.",
"额外对附近2个敌人造成最大生命值8%的伤害，摧毁其80点能量并造成1.5秒眩晕": "Deals DMG equal to 8% of Max HP to 2 nearby enemies. Drains 80 Energy and Stuns for 1.5 sec",
