"额外造成60%攻击力的物理伤害，爆炸后攻击目标在3秒内无法恢复生命": "deals extra PHY DMG equal to 60% of ATK. After the explosion, the target cannot restore HP within 3 sec.",
"贯穿光束": "Blitzkrieg",
