"追加伤害提高至100%，额外造成百分比伤害提高至20%": "Additional DMG increased to 100%, additional percentage DMG increased to 20%",
"集气后打出巨型的龟派气功波，对所有敌人造成$次%%攻击力无视20%防御力的魔法伤害并额外追加100%伤害，自身恢复生命值和能量。": "Releases a giant Kamehameha wave, dealing $ times %% ATK, ignoring 20% MAG DEF to all enemies and an additional 100% DMG, HEAL HP and energy.",
"追加伤害提高至200%，恢复能量提高至250点": "Additional DMG increased to 200% and energy recovery increased to 250",
"变身超赛解锁新技能：界王能源球（给所有敌人造成最大生命值30%的伤害。）": "Transform into a super race to unlock a new skill: Realm King Energy Ball (inflict DMG, 30% of MAX HP to all enemies.)",
