"为自身和最虚弱的一个队友施加一个绿色护盾持续$秒，期间持续恢复生命值。": "Grants a green shield to yourself & the weakest teammate for $ sec, during which HP is continuously restored.",
"当自身在场时，生命值低于40%的友军受到的所有伤害下降一定比例。": "When active on the field, when HP is below 40%, DMG taken by teammates is reduced by a certain percentage.",
"自身生命低于20%时立即恢复20%生命值和250点能量": "Triggered when HP is lower than 20%. Restores 20% HP and 250 Energy",
"黑金弗利萨灵魂石": "Black Frieza(S)",
"黑金弗利萨": "Black Frieza",
"黄金弗利萨修练了10年终于觉醒成黑金形态，据说可以和破坏神对决。": "Black Frieza has been practicing for 10 years and finally awakened into the Black Form, which is said to be able to fight against the God of Destruction.",
"无视30%防御力，若目标生命低于15%则斩杀对方": "Ignores 30% of DEF. Kills targets with HP lower than 15%.",
"额外造成200%攻击力的魔法伤害，恢复技能伤害的80%生命值": "Deals extra MAG DMG equal to 200% of ATK and restores HP equal to 80% of Skill DMG",
"每次攻击额外造成30%攻击力的魔法伤害，攻击目标在9秒内无法恢复能量和生命": "Each attack deals extra MAG DMG equal to 30% of ATK. Targets cannot restore Energy and HP for 9 sec",
"黑金超能量球": "Black Energy Ball",
"打出黄金超能量球对所有敌人造成%%攻击力的魔法伤害并摧毁能量，伤害无视吸收和反弹盾，自身在$秒内免受任何伤害，恢复全体队友能量。": "Fires Black Energy Balls to all enemies to deal MAG DMG equal to %% of ATK which ignores Absorption and Reflect Shield, gaining an IMMUNITY Shield for $ sec. Drains enemies' energy and Restores Energy to all teammates.",
"对目标造成额外3秒眩晕，若目标生命低于20%则斩杀对方，为友军清除所有负面效果": "STUNs targets for 3 sec, Kills targets with HP lower than 20%, Removes all DEBUFFs to all teammates",
"黑金爆星弹": "Black Death Ball",
"用食指聚集能量，凝聚成行星般的超巨大的能量弹对目标造成%%攻击力无视30%防御力的魔法伤害并击退至最后排，额外50%几率产生暴击，使其虚弱在$秒内提高受到的伤害。": "Uses the index finger to gather Energy until it becomes a planet-like huge Energy bomb to deal MAG DMG equal to %% of ATK ignoring 30% of DEF to target and Knocking back to the last row. An extra 50% chance to trigger CRIT. Increases DMG taken by enemy for $ sec.",
"额外造成200%攻击力的魔法伤害，无视50%防御力，对目标造成3秒眩晕，自身获得免伤护盾持续3秒": "Deals extra MAG DMG equal to 200% of ATK, ignores 50% of DEF to target, and STUNs target for 3 sec, receives an IMMUNITY shield for 3 sec.",
"死亡彗星": "Death Comet",
"发出连续气弹，对最后排的$个敌人造成$次%%攻击力魔法伤害并摧毁能量，在$秒内削弱其攻击伤害，伤害无视吸收和反弹盾，自身恢复能量。": "Fires Energy waves continuously to deal MAG DMG equal to %% of ATK to $ enemies in the back row $ times which ignores absorption and reflect shield and reduces their ATK DMG for $ sec. Drains enemies' energy and Restores own.",
"攻击目标在6秒内无法恢复能量和生命，沉默7秒": "Targets cannot restore Energy and HP for 6 sec, and are silenced for 7 sec",
"提高$点单次伤害\n削弱%攻击伤害\n摧毁$点能量\n恢复$点能量": "Increases single DMG by $\nReduces % ATK DMG\nEnergy -$\nRestores $ Energy",
'["伤害+$","攻击伤害-%","能量-$","恢复能量+$"]': '["DMG +$","ATK DMG -%","Energy -$","Restore Energy +$"]',
"提高自身抵抗所有负面效果的几率，当自身生命值低于40%时，立即恢复自身能量和生命值。（一场战斗只能触发一次）": "Increases own DEBUFF Resist rate. When HP is lower than 40%, Energy and HP will be restored instantly (Can only be triggered once per battle)",
"40%几率闪避所有攻击，当自身在场时，全体队友提高70%的攻击伤害，受到百分比伤害最多不超过15%。": "An extra 40% chance to EVADE all attacks. When active on the field, Increases ATK DMG of all teammates by 70% and DMG taken by teammates will not exceed 15% of Max HP",
