"概率公示": "Probability Bulletin",
"1.本游戏是一款MMORPG类游戏，适用于年满12周岁及以上用户，建议未成年人在家长监护下使用游戏产品。\n\n2.本游戏以七龙珠为故事背景进行创作，画面色彩鲜明，人物极致还原，玩法丰富多样；游戏中的角色、伙伴均为七龙珠内人物，完美还原七龙珠故事剧情发展。游戏中有需要多个角色组成战队的团队玩法，还有需要玩家进行阵容搭配，思考阵容优缺点才能冲击更高层的无尽蛇道模式，玩家也可在游戏中基于文字来讨论游戏内的角色，与其他玩家进行良好的交流沟通。\n\n3.本游戏中有着用户实名认证系统，认证为未成年人的用户将接受以下管理：\n（1）游戏中部分玩法和道具需要付费。未满12周岁的用户不能付费;\n（2）12周岁以上未满16周岁的未成年人用户,单次充值金额不得超过50元人民币,每月充值金额累计不得超过200元人民币;\n（3）16周岁以上的未成年人用户,单次充值金额不得超过100元人民币,每月充值金额累计不得超过400元人民币。\n（4）未成年人用户仅可每周五、周六、周日，以及法定节假日的20时—21时登录游戏，使用1小时服务，其余时间无法登录游戏使用游戏服务。\n\n4.游戏玩法中的PVE模式，锻炼玩家思维，利用已拥有的角色进行合适的搭配从而挑战成功，而PVP模式中，有着3V3与5V5的游戏模式，双方各派遣3个战队或者5个战队进行挑战，3局2胜或者5局3胜制度的方式来锻炼玩家的策略谋略，玩家能够以田忌赛马的形式获取胜利或者强强对抗的方式正面打败对手。": "1.This game is a MMORPG game, applicable to users aged 12 and above, minors are recommended to use the game under parental supervision.\n\n2.This game is created with the story background of Seven Dragon Balls, with vivid colorful images, extremely reproducible characters, and rich and diverse gameplay; the characters and partners in the game are all the characters in Seven Dragon Balls, which perfectly reproduces the plot development of the Seven Dragon Balls story. The game has a need for multiple characters to form a team to play, there is a need for players to match the lineup, think about the strengths and weaknesses of the lineup in order to impact the higher level of the endless Snake Road mode, the player can also be based on the text in the game to discuss the role of the game, and other players to have a good exchange of communication.\n\n3. The game has a real-name user authentication system, certified as a minor user will accept the following management：\n(1) The game part of the gameplay and props need to pay. Users under the age of 12 cannot pay;\n(2) For minors over the age of 12 and under the age of 16, the amount of a single recharge shall not exceed RMB 50, and the total amount of a monthly recharge shall not exceed RMB 200;\n(3) For minors over the age of 16, the amount of a single recharge shall not exceed RMB 100, and the total amount of a monthly recharge shall not exceed RMB 400.\n(4) Minor users can only log in to the game every Friday, Saturday, Sunday, and legal holidays from 20:00 to 21:00 to use the service for 1 hour, the rest of the time can not log in to the game to use the game service.\n\n4. The PVE mode in the gameplay exercises players' thinking, utilizing the characters they already own to make appropriate matches and thus challenge for success, while the PVP mode has 3V3 and 5V5 game modes, with each side sending 3 teams or 5 teams to challenge, and the 3-game, 2-win or 5-game, 3-win system to exercise players' strategic strategies, and players are able to obtain victory in the form of the Tennessee Jealousy Horse Race or the strong confrontation to defeat their opponents head-on. Players are able to defeat their opponents head-on in the form of a Tennessee Jealousy Horse Race or Strong Match.",
