"1.通关可获得丰富的奖励": "1. Passing can get fabulous rewards",
"2.英雄的反伤技能在关卡中只能吸收伤害不能反弹给敌人.": "2. The Anti-DMG skills of heros can only absorb, not reflect DMG in the stages.",
"3.每天只能上阵指定的英雄进行战斗.": "3. You can only fight with a specific warrior each day.",
"2.每次觉醒无论成功失败都需要消耗自身的灵魂石，觉醒可解锁新技能.": "2. Each Awaken consumes Soul Stones and can unlock new skills.",
"3.任意膜拜可获得金币奖励，战队等级61-70获得3个巅峰币，71-80级获得4个巅峰币，81-90获得5个巅峰币，91-100获得6个巅峰币.": "3. Any worship will be rewarded with Gold. By worshiping once, team Lv 61~70 can obtain 3 U-Coins, Lv 71~80 4 U-Coins, Lv 81~90 5 U-Coins, Lv 91~100 6 U-Coins.",
"3.任意膜拜可获得金币奖励，战队等级58~60获得4万金币，61-70获得5万金币，71-80级获得6万金币，81-90获得7万金币，91-100获得8万金币.": "3. Any worship will be rewarded with Gold. By worshiping once, team Lv 58~60 can obtain 40K Gold, Lv 61~70 50K Gold, Lv 71~80 60K Gold, Lv 81~90 70K Gold and Lv 91~100 80K Gold.",
"SP活动规则": "SP Event Rule",
"1.梦幻许愿会优先消耗卷轴，钻石许愿限制120次，每满100次许愿必得SP英雄.": "1. Fantasy Wish will consume scrolls first, Diamond Wish limit of 120 times, every full 100 wishes will get SP hero.",
"2.SP活动永久专属头衔，使用后无需穿戴亦可对所有战士生效，重复获取的多余头衔可以找客服换取对应的3星SP战士一个.": "2.SP event is a permanent exclusive title, after use without wearing instant effect on all warriors, repeated access to the excess title can contact GM for the corresponding 3-star SP warrior.",
"3.活动期间超值礼包每日重置限购次数.": "3. During the event, Super Gift reset the limited number of purchases daily.",
"4.战令活动等级初始0级，满级10级。每级固定100活跃度，总需1000活跃度，战令等级经验通过日常活跃度累计.": "4. Military event level initial Lv 0, full Lv 10. Fixed 100 activity per level, total need 1000 activity, Military Level EXP accumulated through daily activity.",
"5.解锁登录豪礼可获得VIP经验x1630.": "5. Unlock Login Gift to get VIP EXP x1630.",
"6.解锁精英战令可获得VIP经验x1630.": "6. Unlock Elite Military to get VIP EXP x1630.",
"7.解锁精英战令的玩家，在活动结束前2天还未领取全部奖励的玩家，可以通过钻石补足需求活跃度.": "7. Players who have unlocked the Elite Military but haven't claimed all the rewards 2days before the end can make up the required AP with Diamonds.",
"1.一个战士可以装备2个胶囊，满觉醒后可以装备3个胶囊.": "1. A warrior can equip 2 capsules and 3 capsules after full awaken.",
"2.胶囊技能同种属性不叠加，比如胶囊1的闪避上级和胶囊2的闪避中级不叠加.": "2. Capsule skills with the same attribute do not stack, for example, capsule 1's EVA senior level and capsule 2's EVA intermediate level do not stack.",
"3.单个胶囊不会重构出相同的技能.": "3. A single capsule will not reconstruct the same skill.",
"4.万能胶囊可以向上5合1至顶级万能胶囊.": "4. Universal capsule can be up 5 in 1 to the top universal capsule.",
"5.布玛的特制胶囊由3个顶级万能胶囊和1个能量脉冲装置合成.": "5. Bulma's special capsule is synthesized from 3 top universal capsules and 1 energy pulsar device.",
"6.万能胶囊和重构能源可通过每日活动宝箱、杂货商店、武斗商店、巅峰商店以及运营活动获得.": "6. Universal Capsules and Refactor Energy can be obtained through Daily Event Chests, Grocery Store, Warrior Shop, Universe Shop and Operational Event.",
