"野兽悟饭灵魂石": "Beast Gohan(S)",
"破坏神贝吉塔灵魂石": "Destroyer Vegeta(S)",
"白发贝吉特灵魂石": "White-haired Vegito Soul Stone",
"野兽悟饭": "Beast Gohan",
"野兽悟饭是神秘悟饭的升级版本，红眼白发的野兽悟饭同时拥有悟空与贝吉塔的能力，悟空与贝吉塔可是经过了艰苦地修炼，才有了现在的局面，悟饭吼了一下子就凌驾于他们之上。": "Beast Gohan is an upgraded version of Mystic Gohan, the red-eyed, white-haired Beast Gohan possesses both Goku and Vegeta's powers. Goku and Vegeta have gone through a grueling training regimen to get to where they are now, and Gohan roars above them all at once.",
"破坏神贝吉塔": "Destroyer Vegeta",
"经过维斯的破坏神培训后，贝吉特逐渐掌握破坏神的力量，全身散发紫色光芒和神秘的符号并且在紫色头发情况可以完全驾驭破坏神的力量。": "After Whis's Destroyer training, Vegeta gradually mastered the power of Destroyer, emitting purple light and mysterious symbols all over his body and fully harnessing the power of Destroyer with his purple hair.",
"白发贝吉特": "White-haired Vegito",
"贝吉特是由孙悟空与贝吉塔使用界王神圣物“坡塔拉耳环”合体诞生的究极战士，在白发状态下为封神白发贝吉特，其破坏力可比肩破坏神": 'Vegito is the ultimate warrior born from the merger of Son Goku and Vegeta using the Kaioshin Sacred  "Potara Earrings", and in his white-haired state he is the God White-Haired Vegito, whose destructive power can be compared to the Destoryer!',
"野兽悟饭普攻": "Beast Gohan Normal ATK",
"野兽龟派气功": "Beast Kamehameha",
"悟饭冲入敌阵聚集能量向前发射强力气功波，对所有敌人造成$次%%攻击力魔法伤害并摧毁敌人能量，$秒内无法恢复生命和能量。释放技能期间免受任何伤害。": "Gohan rushes into the enemy line and gathers energy to fire Powerful Energy Wave forward, dealing $%% ATK MAG DMG to all enemies and destroying their energy, unable to return HP or energy for $ seconds. Gohan is immune to any DMG during the release of the skill.",
"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值2%的伤害": "Each attack deals extra DMG equal to 2% of Max HP",
"野兽冲击拳": "Beast Impact Fist",
"悟饭向冲入敌阵，给生命值最低的一名敌人连续攻击$次%%攻击力物理伤害，每次额外40%几率产生暴击，增加40%暴击伤害，如果目标生命值低于10%，则立即击杀，释放技能期间目标无法行动自身免受任何伤害。": "Gohan rushes into the enemy lineup, giving the enemy with the lowest HP a continuous attack of $%% ATK PHY DMG, each time an additional 40% chance to generate a CRIT, increasing the CRIT DMG by 40%, if the target's HP is less than 10%, it will be killed immediately, the target can not act during the release of the skill to protect themselves from any DMG.",
"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值2%的伤害，自身恢复300点能量": "Each attack deals an additional 2% of maximum HP damage and restores 300 energy to itself",
"集中最大能量，然后将两根手指放在额头前聚集能量，射出超强能量，对最虚弱的一个敌人造成$次%%攻击力魔法伤害，使其在$秒内无法恢复能量和生命。给自己增加一层护盾在$秒内吸收敌人的攻击并反弹。": "Concentrate max energy, then place two fingers in front of the forehead to gather energy and shoot out a supercharged energy that deals $%% ATK MAG DMG to one of the weakest enemies, preventing them from regaining energy and HP for $ seconds. Add a shield to yourself to absorb enemy attacks for $ seconds and bounce back.",
"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值2%的伤害，自身恢复技能伤害的80%生命值": "Each attack deals an additional 2% of max HP damage and restores 80% of the Skill DMG to itself",
"野兽意志": "Beast Will",
"当自身生命值低于40%时变身超级赛亚人并恢复生命值，提升自身能力并减免受到的伤害持续整场战斗，抵抗所有负面状态持续$秒。（一场战斗只能触发一次）": "Transforms into a Super Saiyan and restores HP when HP falls below 40%, boosts your abilities and mitigates DMG taken for the entire battle, and resists all negative statuses for $ seconds.（Can only be triggered once in a battle）",
"变身后能力提高至自身能力的200%，降低60%受到的伤害。自身受到的伤害不超过最大生命值的15%。": "Increase ability to 200% of own ability after transformation, reduce DMG Taken by 60%. DMG Taken to self does not exceed 15% of max HP.",
"自身能力提高%\n恢复%生命值\n降低%受到的伤害": "Increase self ability by % \n Restore % HP \n Decrease DMG Taken by %",
'["能力+%","恢复生命值+%","受到伤害-%"]': '["Ability +%","Restore HP +%","DMG Taken +$"]',
"野兽意志-触发": "Beast Will - Trigger",
"破坏神贝吉塔普攻": "Destroyer Vegeta Normal ATK",
"伽马爆发闪光": "Gamma Burst Flash",
"贝吉塔蓄积最大力量后发出冲击波，对所有敌人造成$次%%攻击力魔法伤害并摧毁能量。敌人将在$秒内无法恢复生命和能量，最前面$个目标将受到双倍伤害。": "Vegeta builds up his max power and sends out a shockwave that deals $%%% ATK MAG DMG to all enemies and destroys energy. Enemies will not be able to return HP and energy for $seconds, and the top $target will take double DMG.",
"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值2%的伤害，若敌人被该技能击杀后无法复活。自身恢复10%的生命值": "Each attack deals an additional 2% of max HP damage, and if the enemy is killed by this skill it cannot be revived. Recovers 10% of its own HP",
"大爆炸袭击": "Big Bang ATK",
"张开手掌并形成一个能量球发出，产生强大的爆炸力，对所有敌人造成%%攻击力的魔法伤害并击晕$秒，失去所有能量。自身恢复生命值。": "Open your palms and form a ball of energy to send out, creating a powerful explosion that deals %% of ATK MAG DMG to all enemies and stuns for $ seconds, losing all energy. Recovers its own HP.",
