"若目标生命低于15%则斩杀对方": "Decapitates the opponent if the target's HP is lower than 15%",
"开场为全体队友生成破坏神托破15%生命值的护盾。被动：降低自身受到的伤害，每当有单位阵亡时对随机一个敌人造成最大生命值的一定比例伤害。（分身和召唤物阵亡无效）": "Generat a shield of 15% of the HP of Destroyer Toppo for all allies at start. Passive：Reduces DMG Taken by itself and deals a percentage of its max HP to a random enemy whenever a unit is killed in battle.（Not valid for Clone and Caster deaths）",
"瞬移到能量最高的敌人面前打出气功波，对其造成$次%%攻击力无视60%防御力的魔法伤害并摧毁能量，额外60%几率产生暴击，提高40%暴击伤害，若目标生命低于50%则额外造成100%伤害。（技能不会被打断）": "Teleports to the enemy with the highest Energy to release Energy waves dealing MAG DMG equal to %% of ATK which ignores 60% of DEF $ times. An extra 50% chance to trigger CRIT and increase CRIT DMG by 40%. If the target's HP is lower than 50%, extra 100% DMG will be dealt.",
"凝聚蓝焰能量弹并打出，对随机$个敌人造成%%攻击力物理伤害并摧毁能量，使其虚弱在$秒内提高受到的伤害并移除目标身上的增益效果。若目标生命低于20%则额外造成100%伤害。": "Gathers the blue-flamed Energy and fires at $ random enemies to deal PHY DMG equal to %% of ATK and drain their Energy. Increases DMG taken by them for $ sec and removes their buffs. Deal an additional 100% DMG if the target's HP is below 20%.",
"额外造成80%攻击力的魔法伤害，摧毁能量提高至250点，恢复能量提高至150点": "Deals extra MAG DMG equal to 80% of ATK, increases Energy Drain to 250 and Energy Restore to 150",
"提高自身攻击速度，提高自身抵抗所有负面效果的几率，增加15%暴击伤害，自身受到伤害最多不超过最大生命值的一定比例。": "Increases own ATK SPD, Debuff Resist rate and CRIT DMG by 15%. DMG taken will not exceed a certain portion of Max HP.",
"增加暴击伤害提高至30%，自身受到伤害最多不超过最大生命值的13%": "Increase CRIT DMG to 30% and take up to 13% of your max HP in damage to yourself",
"额外造成60%攻击力的魔法伤害，百分比伤害提高至25%": "Deals extra MAG DMG equal to 60% of ATK, increases Percent DMG to 25%",
"提高自身抵抗所有负面效果的几率，自身受到伤害最多不超过最大生命值的一定比例，自身每损失10%生命值恢复全体队友4%血量。": "Increases own Debuff Resist rate. DMG taken will not exceed a certain portion of Max HP. For every 10% loss of HP, restores HP of all teammates by 4%.",
"自身每损失10%生命值恢复全体队友7%血量": "For every 10% loss of HP, restores HP of all teammates by 7%",
"发出5个能量球，充能后清除所有负面效果并恢复15%生命值": "Upon charging, sends out 5 Energy balls, clearing all Debuffs and restore 15% HP",
