"争霸赛等待报名开启": "Championship awaits the opening of signups",
"争霸赛现在可以报名，截止至晚上12点": "The registration of Championship starts now and ends at 00:00",
"争霸赛32强入围时间为12:00": "The Top 32 Match will be held at 20:00",
"争霸赛16强入围时间为20:00": "The Top 16 Match will be held at 20:00",
"争霸赛8强入围时间为12:00": "The Top 8 Match will be held at 20:00",
"争霸赛8强决赛时间为20:00": "The final of Top 8 Match will be held at 20:00",
"是否花费$1钻石购买1次挑战次数?(今日已购买$2次)": "Spend $1 Diamond to buy 1 challenge? (Already $2 times today)",
"龙珠阵营：$1": "DB Camp: $1",
"PVE战力": "PVE CP",
"没有该英雄的恶魔果实": "No Devil Fruit for this warrior",
"结算奖励中": "In Settlement Rewards",
"超级赛亚双龙争霸获得第一名": "Win 1st place in Super Saiyan Dragon Battle",
"人造人双龙争霸获得第一名": "Win 1st place in Android Dragon Battle",
"魔人布欧双龙争霸获得第一名": "Win 1st place in Majin Buu Dragon Battle",
"宇宙强者双龙争霸获得第一名": "Win 1st place in Cosmic Power Dragon Battle",
"传超赛亚双龙争霸获得第一名": "Win 1st place in Super Saiyan Dragon Battle",
"被吸血减免": "Anti-Lifesteal",
"跨服双龙争霸规则说明": "C.S. Dragon Battle Rules",
"1.双龙争霸有五个主题，轮流开启，每个主题有限定英雄，只能上阵指定的英雄。": "1. There are 5 themes of Dragon Battle, which are opened in turn, each theme has limited warriors, and can only take on the specified warriors.",
"1.第一天报名参加，必须派遣3只队伍，每支队伍必须上阵2个英雄，根据派遣的3只队伍总战力排名进入32强入围赛，报名人数不足32人时报名玩家将同时参与多组比赛.": "1.The first day of registration to participate, you must send 3 teams, each team must play 2 warriors, according to the TP of the 3 teams dispatched ranked into the top 32 finalists, the number of applicants is less than 32 registered players will be involved in a number of groups at the same time the game.",
"2.争霸赛分5个战区，分别为70级争霸赛（61~70级）、80级争霸赛（71~80）、90级争霸赛（81~90）、95级争霸赛（91~95级）、100级争霸赛（96~100级），根据自己战队等级报名参加相应的比赛.": "2. The Championship is divided into 5 battle zones, respectively, Lv.70 Battle (Lv.61 ~ 70), Lv.80 Battle (Lv.71 ~ 80), Lv.90 Battle (Lv.81 ~ 90), Lv.95 Battle (Lv.91 ~ 95 level), Lv.100 Battle (Lv.96 ~ 100 level), according to the level of their own team to sign up for the corresponding matches.",
"3.第二天12:00根据总战力排行决出32强入围名单，并邮件发放32强奖励.": "3. On Day2 at 12:00, the top 32 roster is determined by the TP ranking, and rewards are sent via mail.",
"4.第二天20:00根据3V3竞技结果决出16强入围名单，并邮件发放16强奖励.": "4. On Day2 at 20:00, the top 16 roster is determined by the 3V3 Arena results, and rewards are sent via mail.",
"5.第三天12:00根据3V3竞技结果决出8强入围名单，并邮件发放8强奖励.": "5. On Day3 at 12:00, the top 8 roster is determined by the 3V3 Arena results, and rewards are sent via mail.",
"6.第三天20:00根据3V3竞技结果决出4强和冠军，并邮件发放4强和冠军奖励.": "6. On Day3 at 20:00, the top 4 roster is determined by the 3V3 Arena results, and rewards are sent via mail.",
"7.第二天20:00~第三天20:00所有玩家都可以在5个战区中对8强进行押注冠军，押注资源80钻，押注成功奖励翻倍，失败则退还押注资源.": "7. From Day2 at 20:00 to Day3 at 20:00, all players can bet on the champion of the top 8 in the 5 zones. A bet costs 80 Diamonds. Winners get 2x bets. If you lose, your bet will be returned.",
"2.每个主题各个战场第一名的玩家将会显示在界面上，可被其他玩家膜拜.": "2. The champion of each zone in every theme will be displayed to receive worship from players.",
"3.任意膜拜可获得奖励，51~60获得2万金币，61-70获得8个钻石，71-80级获得10个钻石，81-90获得1个龙珠币，91-100获得2个龙珠币.": "3. Any worship will be rewarded. By worshiping once, Lv 51~60 can earn 20K Gold, Lv 61~70 8 Diamond, Lv 71~80 10 Diamond, Lv 81~90 1 DB-Coins, Lv 91~100 2 DB-Coins.",
"龙珠收藏家关卡": "DB Collector Stage",
"1.龙珠收藏家副本共有3条难度线，分别为普通、困难、究极难。难度越高奖励越高，究极难线作为特殊副本，适合满配队伍极限挑战，只需1关即可达成排行榜门槛。": "1. There are 3 difficulty lines in the Dragon Ball Collector's Dungeon, which are Normal, Hard and S+ Hard. The higher the difficulty, the higher the reward, the S+ Hard line as a special dungeon, suitable for full team extreme challenge, only 1 stage can reach the leaderboard threshold.",
"2.每日循环限定龙珠[绿蓝紫橙红]阵营战士上阵。": "2. Daily cycle is limited to Dragon Ball [green, blue, purple, orange and red] camp warriors in battle.",
"3.每天共有10次免费挑战次数，可额外购买5次；挑战成功获取奖励后扣除挑战次数，挑战失败则不扣除挑战次数。": "3. There are 10 free challenges per day, and you can purchase 5 additional challenges; the number of challenges will be deducted after successfully obtaining rewards, and the number of challenges will not be deducted if the challenge fails.",
"4.战士的反伤技能在关卡中只能吸收伤害不能反弹给敌人。": "4. The warrior's Anti-DMG skills in the stage can only absorb DMG, can not rebound to the enemy.",
"5.龙珠系统PVE战力加成仅对该副本有效。": "5. Dragon Ball system PVE power bonus is only effective for this dungeon.",
"6.周日23点59分根据本周通关数进行排行奖励结算，同关卡数以玩家[绿蓝紫橙红]阵营战士总战力进行排行；究极难关卡排行额外获得龙珠碎片自选宝箱。": "6. The ranking rewards will be settled at 23:59 on Sunday according to the weekly clearance count, and the same clearance count will be ranked by the warriors' TP of the player's [Green, Blue, Purple, Orange and Red] camp; the ranking of the S+ Hard will be rewarded with an additional Dragon Ball(S) Optional Chest.",
"普通和困难线排行奖励规则如下（通关10关才能获得奖励）：": "Normal and Hard Ranking Reward Rules ( Pass 10 stages to get the reward):",
"究极难线排行奖励规则如下：": "S+ Hard Ranking Reward Rules",
