"梦想国度活动": "Dreamland Event",
"飞向敌人上方发出多束光线，对所有敌人造成$次%%攻击力物理伤害并禁止回血和回能$秒，同时给敌人额外造成$%的生命伤害。本次施放后有20%几率再次释放该技能。": "Fly above enemies and send out multiple beams of light, dealing $%%% of ATK PHY DMG to all enemies and disabling blood and energy regeneration for $seconds, while dealing an additional 10% HP DMG to enemies and restoring self energy.",
"造成的百分比伤害提高至20%，本次施放后有30%几率再次释放该技能": "Increases Percent DMG Taken to 20%.There is a 30% chance that this skill will be released again after this skill.",
"一只手举向上空聚集能量后投向敌军，对最前排的$个敌人造成%%攻击力物理伤害并眩晕$秒，同时给敌人额外造成$%的生命伤害，自身恢复生命值。本次释放后有30%几率再次释放该技能。": "One hand is raised overhead to gather energy and then cast at the enemy, dealing %% ATK PHY DMG and stunning $ seconds to the frontmost $ enemy, while dealing an additional 15% HP DMG to the enemy and restoring own HP. There is a 30% chance that this skill will be released again after this skill.",
"造成的百分比伤害提高至15%，本次施放后有40%几率再次释放该技能": "Increases Percent DMG Taken to 15%.There is a 40% chance that this skill will be released again after this skill.",
"集气后打出巨型的龟派气功波，对所有敌人造成$次%%攻击力无视$%防御力的魔法伤害，同时给敌人额外造成$%的生命伤害。": "Ki Harvest to hit a giant Kamehameha, dealing $ times %%ATK and ignore 20% DEF's MAG DMG to all enemies and an additional 10% HP Damage to enemies.",
"本次施放后有40%几率再次释放该技能": "There is a 40% chance that this skill will be released again after this skill.",
"百分比伤害、双重施放、必杀增益": "Percent DMG, Double Release, Enhance Ulti.Skill",
"超新星爆破": "Supernova Blast",
"汇聚能量投掷出超新星，对最虚弱的$个敌人造成$次%%攻击力的魔法伤害并眩晕$秒。若目标生命低于50%则额外追加伤害70%，若目标生命低于15%则斩杀对方。恢复自身能量。": "Gather energy and hurl a Supernova, dealing %% of ATK MAG DMG and stunning $seconds to the weakest $ enemy. If the target's HP is below 50%,then 70% additional DMG, decapitate the opponent if the target's HP is below 15%. Restores your own energy.",
"手中形成圆盘投掷出去，对最虚弱的$个敌人造成$次%%攻击力的魔法伤害并眩晕$秒，若目标生命低于50%则额外追加伤害60%，若目标生命低于10%则斩杀对方。": "Forms a disk in the hand and throws it, dealing %% of ATK MAG DMG to the weakest $enemy and stunning it for $seconds, decapitating the opponent if the target's HP is below 50%, then 60% addtional DMG, if the target's HP is below 10%, then kill the opponent.",
