"用于合成和升阶[悟饭宝剑]:悟饭用过宝剑，攻击时$1概率摧毁对方全部能量": "Used to combine [Gohan Sword]:Gohan has used the sword, which has a $1 chance of destroying all the opponent's energy when attacking.",
"赛亚神特兰克斯": "Saiyan God Trunks Normal ATK",
"作为时空巡逻队中活跃的一员，也是另一个次元的未来特兰克斯。因擅自改变历史而被时之界王神带到时之巢，组建了时空巡逻队，扭转错误的历史。": "As an active member of the Time Patrol and another future Trunks from a different timeline, he was brought to the Time Nest by the Supreme Kai of Time for altering history without authorization. He then formed the Time Patrol to correct the errors in history.",
"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值2%的伤害，技能必然命中和暴击": "Each attack deals extra DMG equal to 2% of Max HP, skills certain to Hit and Crit",
"悟饭向冲入敌阵，给生命值最低的一名敌人连续攻击$次%%攻击力物理伤害，每次额外40%几率产生暴击，增加40%暴击伤害，如果目标生命值低于30%，则立即击杀，释放技能期间目标无法行动自身免受任何伤害。": "Gohan rushes into the enemy lineup, giving the enemy with the lowest HP a continuous attack of $%% ATK PHY DMG, each time an additional 40% chance to generate a CRIT, increasing the CRIT DMG by 40%, if the target's HP is less than 30%, it will be killed immediately, the target can not act during the release of the skill to protect themselves from any DMG.",
"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值5%的伤害，自身恢复300点能量": "Each attack deals extra DMG equal to 2% of Max HP and restores 300 energy to itself",
"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值5%的伤害，自身恢复技能伤害的80%生命值": "Each attack deals extra DMG equal to 2% of Max HP and restores 80% of the Skill DMG to itself",
"赛亚神特兰克斯普攻": "Saiyan God Trunks Normal ATK",
"关键之剑-破斩": "Critical Sword - Slash",
"特兰克斯将全部力量凝聚在关键之剑上，对面前的所有目标疯狂斩击造成$次%%攻击力的物理伤害，并造成流血$秒每秒流失$%生命值且无法恢复生命值，若目标生命低于$%则额外造成$%伤害。（流血可叠加）": "Trunks concentrates all his power into the Critical Sword, wildly slashing all targets in front of him, dealing PHY DM equal to $ times the ATK. Additionally, it causes bleeding for $ seconds, resulting in the loss of $% HPper second, which cannot be restored. If the target's HP is below $%, it inflicts an additional $% DMG. (Bleeding can stack)",
"该技能可以破除护盾和清除敌人增益效果，击杀的目标禁止复活": "This skill can break shields and remove enemy gain effects, and targets killed are forbidden to be revived.",
"灿然斩": "Brilliant Slash",
"特兰克斯向前跳跃至最后排敌人上方，拔出剑并朝头上挥去，造成$次%%攻击力的物理范围伤害。造成流血$秒每秒流失$%生命值且无法恢复生命值。自身和血量最低的一名友军恢复生命值。": "Trunks leaps forward above the enemies in the back row, drawing his sword and swinging it downward, dealing physical area DMG equal to %%% of his attack. Causes bleeding for $ seconds, loses $% of HP per second and can't restore HP. Trunks and the lowest HP ally restore HP.",
"完全清空敌人能量": "Completely empty the enemy's energy.",
"提高$点单次伤害\n恢复%生命值": "Increase $ points of single DMG \n restore % HP",
"空间切割": "Space Slice",
"向前挥出强力斩击造成空间切割，对敌方全体造成$次%%攻击力的魔法伤害，并形成重力磁场造成压制效果$秒期间攻速强制为零。": "Swings a powerful slash forward to inflict Space Slice, inflicting $%% TK MAG DMG to all enemies and creating Gravity Magnetic Field to inflict a suppression effect for $ seconds during which ATK SPD is forced to 0",
"压制效果时间提高至12秒": "Suppression effect time increased to 12 seconds",
"燃烧能量": "Burning Energy",
"自身每秒流失1%生命值，完全免疫百分比真实伤害，每10秒解除自身所有负面效果，受到伤害不超过最大生命值的一定比例。": "Self loses 1% of HP per second, is completely immune to percentage DMG, removes self from all negative effects every 10 seconds, and takes no more than a certain ratio of max HP in DMG",
"自身每秒流失0.5%生命值，每8秒解除自身所有负面效果": "Lose 0.5% of own HP per second, and remove all negative effects every 8 seconds.",
"单次最多受到最大生命值的%伤害": "Take up to % of max HP DMG once.",
