"清空能量概率": "Empty Energy",
"1.当英雄等级达到50级3星开启战魂功能。英雄突破至4星开放速度之魂，突破至5星开放生命之魂和能量之魂，突破至5月开放坚韧之魂和致命之魂，突破至5日开放抵抗之魂和霸王之魂。": "1. When the hero level reaches 50 3 stars to open the war soul function. Hero breakthrough to 4 stars opens the SPD Soul, breakthrough to 5 stars opens the Life Soul and Energy Soul, breakthrough to 5 moon opens the Tenacity Soul and Lethal Soul, breakthrough to 5 sun opens the RES Soul and the Overlord Soul.",
"2.战魂分8种类型，每种可通过对应的源石进行升级，上限为10级。": "2. There are 8 types of War Souls, each of which can be upgraded by the corresponding Source Stone, with a max of 10 levels.",
"3.SP英雄战魂升级需要消耗额外的战魂精魄。": "3.SP Heroes War Soul upgrades require additional War Soul Essence to be consumed.",
"4.SSS英雄所有战魂等级达到1级时，可以激活头像框特效。": "4. SSS heroes can activate the avatar frame effect when all the War Souls reach lv.1.",
"5.SP英雄所有战魂等级分别达到1、3、5、8、10级时，可以激活5种不同的头像框特效。": "5. SP heroes can activate 5 different avatar frame effects when all their War Soul levels reach lv.1, 3, 5, 8, and 10 respectively",
"星球争夺战规则": "Planet Battle Rules",
"1.跨服实时占领玩法，按等级分4个战场，每个战场有3个独立区域，每个区域有1个顶级资源点、2个高级资源点、3个中级资源点、无限个初级资源点。玩家总共最多占领3个地区，每个资源点完全占领需要8小时.": "1. The CS real-time occupation gameplay is divided into 4 battlefields according to levels, each battlefield has 3 independent areas, each area has 1 top resource point, 2 advanced resource points, 3 mid-level resource points, and unlimited primary resource points. Players can occupy up to 3 areas in total, and it takes 8 hours to fully occupy each resource point",
"2.英雄上阵要求：不低于战场等级，且必须上阵5名英雄.": "2. Requests for heroes: not lower than the battlefield level, and 5 heroes must be on the battlefield.",
"3.中高顶级资源点完全占领有几率额外产出奖励，级别越高概率越高.": "3.There is a chance that the mid-level, advanced, and top resource points will produce extra rewards if they are fully occupied, and the higher the level, the higher the probability.",
"4.掠夺成功会掠夺他人一定比率的已产出资源并占领该资源点。掠夺成功后会进入被掠夺者的仇人名单中，复仇可掠夺双倍资源，复仇成功后将其移除仇人.": "4. Successful looting will result in the looting of a certain rate of another person's produced resources and the occupation of that resource point. If you succeed in looting, you will be entered into the enemy list of the looted person, and revenge can double the resources you looted, and you will be removed from the enemy list after you succeed in revenge.",
"5.玩家占领时可请求护卫，护卫可以代替原队伍接受挑战，护卫队伍的战力必须大于原队伍30%战力以上才可护卫，护卫没有奖励，但可以参与获得排行奖励.": "5. Players can request an guard when occupying, the guard can accept the challenge instead of the original team, the guard team's CP must be greater than the original team's CP of 30% or more to guard, the guard has no rewards, but can participate in the rankings of the rewards.",
"6.战败惩罚：掠夺或护卫失败的队伍会进入死亡状态，4小时不得再次上阵，可消耗战魂币复活.": "6. Defeat Penalty: The team that fails to loot or guard will enter the death state, and may not go into battle again for 4 hours, and can consume War Soul Coins to resurrect.",
"7.4个战场分别根据本周【掠夺资源量】和【护卫成功次数】进行排行，周日23.59分结算。奖励如下：": "7. The 4 battlefields will be ranked according to the [Loot Resources Quantity] and [Guard Success Times] this week, and will be settled at 23:59 on Sunday. The rewards are as follows:",
