"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值3%的伤害，若敌人被该技能击杀后无法复活。自身恢复10%的生命值": "Each attack deals an extra DMG of 3% of max HP, and if the enemy is killed by this skill, it cannot be revived. Restores 10% of its own HP",
"贝吉塔拥有躲避攻击的能力，开场提高全体队友闪避率和攻击速度持续$秒。": "Vegeta has the ability to Dodge ATK and increase the EVA rate and ATK SPD for all ally for $ seconds in opening.",
"濒死时短暂无敌并清除负面状态变身超级破坏神贝吉塔半裸形态，提升自身能力持续整场战斗并恢复生命值和能量。（一场战斗只能触发一次）。自身受到伤害最多不超过最大生命值的一定比例。": "When dying, briefly becomes invincible and removes negative statuses to transform into Super Destroyer Vegeta's half-naked form, increasing his abilities for the entire battle and restoring his HP and Energy. (Can only be triggered once in a battle). Suffers DMG up to a percentage of its max HP.",
