"你在此次钻石消费排行活动中排名第$1,奖励已发放，请查收。": "You are ranked #1 in this Diamond Cost Ranking event, the reward has been sent, please check.",
"进入超神形态后立即恢复80%生命值，自身能力提高100%，自身受到不超过最大生命值10%的伤害。全队攻击速度提高至80%。": "Immediately restores 80% HP upon entering Godly Form, increases your own abilities by 100%, and suffers DMG to yourself that does not exceed 10% of your max HP.",
"跨服钻石消费排行榜": "C.S. Diamond Cost Ranking",
"在活动时间内钻石消费上榜获得相应奖励,如果消费没达到则获得后面排名的奖励": "During the event, the diamond cost can be listed on the ranking, you can get the relevant rewards, if the cost does not meet the conditions will get the rewards of the back rankings",
