"人造人21号": "Android 21",
"谜之科学家。身为女性不仅有着超强实力，还拥有可以与格罗博士匹敌的头脑。似乎与人造人16号的复活有些关联。": "An enigma scientist. Being a woman not only has super strength, but also has a mind that rivals Dr.Gero’s. Seems to have some connection with the resurrection of Android 16.",
"为友军清除所有负面效果并移除敌军所有增益效果": "Remove all negative effects for ally and remove all bonus effects for enemy troops.",
"每次攻击额外造成最大生命值3%的伤害，技能必然命中和暴击": "Each attack deals an extra 3% DMG of max HP, skills are bound to hit and crit",
"变身后能力提高100%，降低60%受到的伤害。自身受到的伤害不超过最大生命值的10%。": "After transforming, increase Ability by 100% and reduce DMG Taken by 60%. Self-DMG Taken does not exceed 10% of maximum life value.",
"人造人21号普攻": "Android 21 Normal ATK",
"原子爆裂弹": "Atomic Blast Boom",
