"恢复技能伤害80%的生命值": "Restore 80% HP of Skill DMG",
"提高$点单次伤害\n造成最大生命值的%伤害\n恢复$点能量": "Increase $ points of single DMG \n Deal % DMG of max HP \n Restore $ points of Energy",
'["伤害+$","伤害+%","恢复能量+$"]': '["DMG +$", "DMG +%", "Restore Energy +$"]',
"特殊β射线": "Special β Ray",
