"解除魅惑的掉血要求提高至20%，魅惑效果必然命中无法抵抗": "Requirement for HP Loss to remove Charm increase to 20%, and Charm Effect is bound to hit and cannot be resisted.",
"环形连斩": "Toroidal Claw",
"突进至血量最高的敌人面前，用手刀进行环形的连续斩击，对敌人造成$次%%攻击力的魔法伤害，并持续魅惑直到目标流失$%生命值以上才会解除。": "Burst forward to the highest HP and perform a circular continuous slash with Energy Blade, dealing $%% ATK of MAG DMG to the enemy and continuing to charm until the target loses $% HP or more before removing it.",
"解除魅惑的掉血要求提高至30%，魅惑效果必然命中无法抵抗": "Requirement for HP Loss to remove Charm increase to 30%, and Charm Effect is bound to hit and cannot be resisted.",
"神秘女性": "Mysterious Female",
"自身受到的伤害不超过最大生命值的一定比例。当血量低于20%时，自身短暂无敌并解除负面效果，随机魅惑一个敌人持续整场战斗。（一场战斗只能触发一次）": "DMG Taken to self does not exceed a certain percentage of max HP. When HP is below 20%, self is briefly invincible and removes negative effects, charming a random enemy for the entire battle. (Can only be triggered once per battle)",
