"橙色比克普攻": "Orange Piccolo Normal ATK",
"将右手的两根手指放到前额聚集能量，再从两根手指射出超强能量束，对所有敌人造成$次%%攻击力的魔法伤害，被击中后无法复活且有$%概率被秒杀。另对最远的一名敌人额外造成一次伤害。": "Place two fingers of the right hand on the forehead to gather energy, then shoot out a super Energy beam from the two fingers, dealing MAG DMG equal to $ times % of ATK to all enemies. Those hit cannot be resurrected and have a $% chance of being killed instantly. Additionally, deal extra DMG to the farthest enemy.",
