"变化出$个具有很强战斗力的分身进行战斗，分身可以使用迅猛一击，当比克巨大化时分身也享受巨大化效果。": "Transform into $ powerful clones for combat, capable of using swift strikes. When Piccolo enlarges, the clones also benefit from the enlargement effect.",
"每个分身死亡时随机使一名敌人流失10%生命值": "Upon each clone's death, a random enemy loses 10% of their HP",
"迅猛一击": "Swift Strike",
"蓄力向前打出极其凶猛的一击，对面前的敌人造成%%攻击力的物理伤害并击退至最后一排，随后使目标恐惧往反方向逃跑持续$秒。": "Charge up for a Swift Strike, dealing %% of ATK in P.DMG to the enemy in front, knocking them back to the last row, and causing fear, making them run in the opposite direction for $ seconds.",
"额外造成20%生命值伤害": "Deal an extra DMG equal to 20% of MAX HP",
"巨大化": "Enlarge",
"当自身生命值低于50%时解除所有负面效果，爆发巨大能量使全身巨大化，大幅提高自身能力，提高攻击伤害和免伤效果，但巨大化的代价是速度变慢，攻速减少$%。（每场战斗只能触发一次）": "When HP drops below 50%, remove negative effects, enlarge the body with a burst of energy to greatly enhance abilities, attack damage, and DMG Reduction. However, enlargement slows down speed, reducing ATK Speed by $%. (Can only trigger once per battle)",
"巨大化时恢复满血和满能量": "Upon enlargement, restore full HP and Energy",
"自身能力提高%\n提高%攻击伤害，降低%受到的伤害": "Enhance own abilities by% \n Increase ATK DMG by %, reduce DMG Taken by %",
'["能力+%","攻击伤害+%","受到伤害-%"]': '["Ability +%","ATK DMG +%","DMG Taken -%"]',
